  {
   "kind": "slider-design-pleasure",
   "id": "anchor_main-points",
   "title": "Where Performance Meets Luxury",
   "intro": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "Alpine Flair",
     "text": "The exciting new partnership with with the high-end sport speciality brand Alpine allows BENETEAU to offer a limited edition version of the new Gran Turismo yachts, featuring such elements as a striking Signal Grey hull complemented by sleek black accents on the engine covers, light fittings, door handles, cleats, rails, screen mounts, and the helm console. Inside, Navy Blue highlights enhance the furniture, upholstery, and embroidery, creating a unique and unforgettable atmosphere. The result will spark fascination wherever you go."
    },
    {
     "title": "Villa-Style Outdoor Living on the Water",
     "text": "Experience the feeling of villa living aboard the Gran Turismo 35, featuring hinge-down balconies, a modular cockpit layout and convertible sun pads. Perfect for entertaining, relaxing, sunbathing or a top-speed run to your local anchorage, this spacious outdoor area seamlessly connects you with the water, creating the ultimate outdoor cruising experience."
    },
    {
     "title": "Sophisticated & Functional Interior Design",
     "text": "Step inside a bright, open layout with light wood finishes and the lovely feel of minimalistic beauty. The Gran Turismo 35 offers two double berths, a huge, fully enclosed head with shower, and a well-equipped galley, all designed for perfect weekend getaways and overnight stays."
    },
    {
     "title": "Exceptional Speed & Maneuverability",
     "text": "Powered by twin Mercury Verado outboards, the base Gran Turismo 35 reaches over 41 knots, delivering thrilling speed and diamond-cut handling. Docking and close-quarter maneuvers are a breeze with joystick control, and picture-perfect helm station ergonomics make this a boat that is just begging to be driven."
    }
   ],
